        {
          "title": "Pitch with Fives",
          "subtitle": "Catch Five",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Pitch with Fives (Catch Five) is a Pitch variant with only one scoring five: the trump 5 (5 points). Nine points total per hand: high, low, jack, game, five. 4p partnerships, 6 cards, purge non-trumps, refill. Must follow suit. 31 to win."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Original Pedro had only one scoring five (9 points). Pitch with Fives preserves this. Judd A. Schorr; Catch Five in some regions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "4 in partnerships. Partners opposite."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Standard 52 cards."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card deck."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "6 each. One round of bidding."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
